    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Our podcast seeks to explore the idea of respect for women in the workforce, through the juxtaposition of the sex industry and the tech industry. Through interviews with friends and professionals, Zoe's podcast opens a conversation about the lack of women in computer science, both in education and industry, and how the gender balance has changed since the creation of the field. Audrey's podcast focuses on the idea of college students working in the sex industry to fund there education. It looks at the stigma associated with this industry, and questions whether people's perception does or should change due to the involvement of college students. The podcast is largely constructed through the voiced and opinions of college students in 2014. These two beautifully blended through the incorporation of the Australian TV show, Beauty and the Geek.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
